{"id":"1aa3ad8d378fa3a5","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-feasible-interpolation.md","title":"Feasible Interpolation","display":"thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-feasible-interpolation","aliases":["72-thm-feasible-interpolation"],"display":"thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]","[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","[[72-df-boolean-circuit]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 9.3.5; printed pp. 613-615; PDF pp. 625-627","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"Both source constructions reviewed; linear gate-count induction and all proof annotations not fully reconstructed","round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-feasible-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-feasible-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"789eea8538e194e6\" href=\"?note=789eea8538e194e6\" title=\"72-df-boolean-circuit\">72-df-boolean-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 9.3.5; printed pp. 613-615; PDF pp. 625-627"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Both source constructions reviewed; linear gate-count induction and all proof annotations not fully reconstructed"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a\">\\(\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历有限子句集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\">\\(\\operatorname{ResRefutation}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\">\\(X,Y,Z\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})\\)</span>；下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}\">\\(\\operatorname{Split}\\)</span> 显式约束其两两不交和两侧变量范围。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"789eea8538e194e6\" href=\"?note=789eea8538e194e6\" title=\"72-df-boolean-circuit\">72-df-boolean-circuit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 遍历有限子句序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|d|\">\\(|d|\\)</span> 表示其固定编码位数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\)</span> 是下面按子句及公共变量赋值定义的谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{X}\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{X}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 遍历从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle d,A,B,X,Y,Z\\rangle\">\\(\\langle d,A,B,X,Y,Z\\rangle\\)</span> 的标准二进制编码到电路编码的总多项式时间函数，电路码采用显式有限门列表与二进制索引。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\">\\(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}\\)</span> 是总多项式时间解析函数，在合法编码上返回所编码的有限门系统，在非法编码上返回单个常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 门。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}\\)</span> 为 Assertion 定义的有限子句集合变量支持函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists D\\in A\\;(p\\in D\\lor\\neg p\\in D)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists D\\in A\\;(p\\in D\\lor\\neg p\\in D)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nX\\cap Y=X\\cap Z=Y\\cap Z=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)\\subseteq X\\cup Y\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(B)\\subseteq X\\cup Z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nX\\cap Y=X\\cap Z=Y\\cap Z=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)\\subseteq X\\cup Y\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(B)\\subseteq X\\cup Z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\Bigl(b\\upharpoonright X=a\\land\n\\forall D\\in A\\;\\exists l\\in D\\;⟦ l⟧_b=1\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\Bigl(b\\upharpoonright X=a\\land\n\\forall D\\in A\\;\\exists l\\in D\\;⟦ l⟧_b=1\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathcal E\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall A,B,X,Y,Z,d\\;\n\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\land\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(d,A\\cup B))\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(&amp;C=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{enc}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\leq c|d|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^X\\;\n((⟦ C⟧_a=0\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A))\n\\land(⟦ C⟧_a=1\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(B)))\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathcal E\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall A,B,X,Y,Z,d\\;\n\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\land\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(d,A\\cup B))\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(&amp;C=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{enc}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\leq c|d|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^X\\;\n((⟦ C⟧_a=0\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A))\n\\land(⟦ C⟧_a=1\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(B)))\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 9.3.5，印刷页 613–614，PDF 页 625–626；原书给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(|d|)\">\\(O(|d|)\\)</span> 大小电路，且说明按电路输出可从相应一侧构造不大于原反驳的反驳。这里形式化其中电路提取及两个输出条件，未抄入第二个大小结论。</li>\n<li>修正了原先只用自然语言声称存在 extractor、却没有定义其输入、输出、作用变量或真假条件的缺口。输出为共享变量上的电路，而非要求多项式大小的公式；输出 0 对应左侧不可满足，输出 1 对应右侧不可满足，方向与原书一致。</li>\n<li>本次核对陈述并阅读两种证明思路，未完整重建线性门数估计。给定公共赋值时，对公共枢轴保留变成假的枢轴文字所在父子句，对私有枢轴照常归结；最后空子句的祖先不混合两个私有变量集合。这说明电路可决定哪一侧不可满足。</li>\n<li>Feasible interpolation is a property of particular proof systems; it is not asserted for an arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"789eea8538e194e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；$A,B$ 遍历有限子句集合，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；$A,B$ 遍历有限子句集合，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"789eea8538e194e6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 如 [[72-df-boolean-circuit]]；$d$ 遍历有限子句序列，$|d|$ 表示其固定编码位数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},⟦\\cdot⟧_a","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResRefutation}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Split}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"|d|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle d,A,B,X,Y,Z\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)=\\{p\\in\\mathsf{PV}:\\exists D\\in A\\;(p\\in D\\lor\\neg p\\in D)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nX\\cap Y=X\\cap Z=Y\\cap Z=\\varnothing\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(A)\\subseteq X\\cup Y\n\\land\\operatorname{Var}_{\\mathrm{cl}}(B)\\subseteq X\\cup Z.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\neg\\exists b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\Bigl(b\\upharpoonright X=a\\land\n\\forall D\\in A\\;\\exists l\\in D\\;⟦ l⟧_b=1\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathcal E\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\forall A,B,X,Y,Z,d\\;\n\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Split}(A,B,X,Y,Z)\\land\\operatorname{ResRefutation}(d,A\\cup B))\\to\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n\\exists C\\;\\bigl(&C=\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{circ}}(\\mathcal E(\\operatorname{enc}(d,A,B,X,Y,Z)))\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\leq c|d|\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^X\\;\n((⟦ C⟧_a=0\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(A))\n\\land(⟦ C⟧_a=1\\to\\operatorname{Unsat}_{X,a}(B)))\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"O(|d|)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":3909,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-feasible-interpolation|thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-feasible-interpolation|thm-feasible-interpolation — Feasible Interpolation]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-feasible-interpolation|72-thm-feasible-interpolation]]"}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135","d6da6d3f3489ef90","789eea8538e194e6"]}